    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40455" root="نكب" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَكِيبٌ</span></b>  The <i>circuit</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَائِرَة</span>: in some copies of the
S, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دابرة</span>: but this, as IKtt says, is a mistake;
and the former is the correct word: TA) <i>of a
hoof,</i> (S, K,) <i>and of a camel's foot.</i> (S.) See
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْكَوبٌ</span>.

